Package: mwb-client
Version: 0.1.0-m1
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: mwb-client-linux contributors
Description: Mouse Without Borders client for Linux (Go)
 Speaks the PowerToys MWB wire protocol (current + legacy) as Client and
 Server. X11 + Wayland-portal + evdev-uinput backends with honest runtime
 probing; Wayland GNOME42 without portal runs in restricted mode
 (needs the input group, see /lib/udev/rules.d/99-mwb-client-input.rules).
